    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***PEACEFUL CUL-DE-SAC LOCATION / MATURE TREE-LINED GREEN AREA/ OFF STREET PARKING FOR 2 CARS/ EV CHARGER / BEAUTIFULLY PRESENTED BACK GARDEN / BER C2/ CLOSE TO EXCELLENT TRANSPORT LINKS / NEAR A HOST OF AMENITIES AND PRESTIGIOUS EDUCATIONAL INSTITUTIONS***\r\n\r\nKELLY BRADSHAW are delighted to present Number 49 Seven Oaks, Drumcondra, Dublin 9 to the sales market. This superbly spacious home will be sure to appeal to families looking for a generous property close to all the amenities Drumcondra village has to offer on its doorstep.\r\n\r\nNestled in a serene tree-lined cul-de-sac development just off the prestigious Griffith Avenue, 49 Seven Oaks is a spacious red brick fronted property built in the late 1980's. This property has been beautifully maintained over the years.\r\n\r\nIt presents attractively with a brick façade and mullioned windows. A double driveway offers off-street parking for two cars.\r\n\r\nA storm porch leads into a bright and spacious hallway, where you are met with what can only be described as an impeccably presented home, excellent layout and spacious accommodation throughout. Wood flooring sweeps through the downstairs living accommodation creating a modern polished finish.\r\n\r\nThe hallway leads into the first of the two impressive reception rooms; the formal living room. This beautiful space to the front of the property features generous proportions, chimney breast and elegant coving. The second reception room to the rear is a generous flexible space, currently laid out as a dining room.\r\n\r\nFurther to the rear is a light-filled kitchen overlooking a stunning back garden. The kitchen has a tiled floor and splashback and attractive wood cabinetry. This well designed kitchen boasts; built in fridge freezer,  washing machine, dishwasher, extractor fan, oven and hob. The fully decked  back garden is enormously impressive and boasts an attractive shed for all-important storage. A guest W.C. completes the downstairs accommodation. No Maintenance Composite Decking is fantastic! \r\n\r\nAscending to the upstairs, this property continues to impress with three spacious bedrooms featuring built-in wardrobes and a fully-tiled modern family bathroom with electric shower. Mains dual head thermostatic shower. Combi boiler, Gas central heating, Double Glazing, Stira Loft Ladder ...49 has it all!\r\n\r\n49 Seven Oaks boasts a stunning location, situated only a stone's throw from a wealth of amenities such as Near Drumcondra Station to use the Arrow rail service\r\nOn Quality Bus Corridor (QBC)\r\n\r\nEasy access to Mater, Beaumont and Temple Street and Highfield Hospital.  Close to shops, hotels, gyms and restaurants. Further amenities in the locality include All Hallows College, Maryfield Secondary School, Ard Scoil Ris and DCU.  For the sports enthusiast, Na Fianna Club is right on your doorstep, and Croke Park a short distance away. Nearby Griffith Avenue is famous for its tree-lined wide footpaths, ideal for a leisurely stroll or for the more athletic joggers. The stunning National Botanic Gardens are conveniently close.\r\n\r\nThe City Centre is a short bus ride away and commuters are well catered for in the area with several bus routes serving the locale. Furthermore, the close proximity to Dublin Airport & M1/ M50 Motorways makes this the ideal setting for a family home.\r\n\r\n49 Seven Oaks has so much to offer. Viewing is advisable and available through Kelly Bradshaw."
      },
